A footnote definition's block runs to the end of its body

```
- a
  [^f]: t

    more
tail

x[^f]
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a
[^f]: t</p>
    <p>more
tail</p>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>x[^f]</p>
```

```
- a
  [r]: /u

    more
tail

[r][]
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a
[r]: /u</p>
    <p>more
tail</p>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>[r][]</p>
```
